@title Summer Reading 2026: The Wrap-Up
@subtitle Hollis Public Library, June to August 2026

# Summer at a glance
kpi Registered readers | 1,248
kpi Finished the program | 683 | 54.7% of readers
kpi Books logged | 8,325 | 6.7 per reader
kpi Closing party | 310 | people came

683 of our 1,248 registered children and teens (54.7 percent) finished the summer reading program. Between June and August they logged 8,325 books, or 6.7 books per registered reader. The closing party on 2026-09-12 drew 310 people.

# Books logged by month
data books = month,books; Jun,2340; Jul,3115; Aug,2870
chart bar books labels title="Books logged by month"

July was the busiest month, with 3,115 books logged, 775 more than June.

# Readers by age group
data ages = age group,readers; Under 8,402; 8 to 12,561; 13 to 17,285
chart hbar ages labels title="Registered readers by age group"

Readers aged 8 to 12 were the largest group, with 561 registered. Under 8 had 402 and 13 to 17 had 285.
